## Frontend Patterns

- Dashboard uses a dark theme — match it for new components
- Plan/subscription data must come from live API calls, not stale JWT claims
- Empty states should be helpful with CTAs, not just "0" or "No data"

## Common Commands

```bash
uvicorn backend.main:app --reload --port 8000   # Backend dev
cd frontend && npm run dev                        # Frontend dev
cd frontend && npm run build                      # Frontend build
```

